{"sections":[{"slug":"Chevalley同构","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Chevalley同构"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Chevalley <span lang=\"zh\">同构</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Chevalley 同构”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">是由</span> $\\{\\exp(\\operatorname{ad}(x)): x\\in \\mathfrak g\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">生成的</span> $\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathfrak g)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的子群</span>, $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">是由</span> $\\mathfrak h$ <span lang=\"zh\">类似定义的子群</span>. $W$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Weyl群","text":"Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">也即正规化子</span> $N(H)/H$), <span lang=\"zh\">则</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/不变多项式","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">不变多项式</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathbb{C}[\\mathfrak g]^G \\simeq \\mathbb{C}[\\mathfrak h]^W.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\mathbb{C}[V]:= \\operatorname{Sym}(V^*)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是向量空间</span> $V$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的多项式代数</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">因为</span> $\\mathfrak h\\simeq \\mathfrak b / [\\mathfrak b,\\mathfrak b]$, <span lang=\"zh\">有一个投影</span> $\\pi\\colon  \\mathfrak b\\to\\mathfrak h$.\n$$\r\n\\mathbb{C}[\\mathfrak g] \\overset{i^*}{\\to} \\mathbb{C}[\\mathfrak b] \\overset{\\pi^*}{\\leftarrow} \\mathbb{C}[\\mathfrak h]\r\n$$\n<strong><span lang=\"zh\">引理</span> 1</strong>. $i^*(\\mathbb{C}[\\mathfrak g]^G)\\subset \\pi^*(\\mathbb{C}[\\mathfrak h]^W)$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span>.</strong> <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> Killing <span lang=\"zh\">型</span> $\\mathfrak g \\simeq \\mathfrak g^*$, <span lang=\"zh\">在此对应下有</span> $\\mathfrak h\\simeq \\mathfrak h^*$, $\\mathfrak b^-\\simeq \\mathfrak g / \\mathfrak n \\simeq \\mathfrak b^*$,\n$$\r\ni^*(\\mathbb{C}[\\mathfrak g]^G)\\subset\\mathbb{C}[\\mathfrak b]^H = \\operatorname{Sym}(\\mathfrak b^-)^H = \\operatorname{Sym}(\\mathfrak h)^H\\subset \\operatorname{Sym}(\\mathfrak h)^W.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">由引理</span> 1 <span lang=\"zh\">我们有映射</span> $\\phi\\colon \\mathbb{C}[\\mathfrak g]^G\\to \\mathbb{C}[\\mathfrak h]^W$. …, <span lang=\"zh\">可证明</span> $\\phi$ <span lang=\"zh\">为同构</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}